include system.settings
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol density lx ly lz
thermo 2000
reset_timestep 0
timestep 0.5
fix md all npt temp 330.0 330.0 100.0 z 0.0 0.0 1000.0
dump d all custom 20000 traj.lammpstrj id type element x y z ix iy iz q
dump_modify d sort id element ao at ho hw mgo Na ob obos obts oh ohs ow st
group a_Ow type 12
compute msd_Ow a_Ow msd
fix msd_Ow all ave/time 1 1 200 c_msd_Ow[*] file msd_Ow.dat
group a_Na type 6
compute msd_Na a_Na msd
fix msd_Na all ave/time 1 1 200 c_msd_Na[*] file msd_Na.dat
run 400000
write_data final.data
